---
import { APLD_CURRENT_PRICE, APLD_PRICE_DATE, apldReported } from '../../data/apld-valuation';
interface Props { language?: 'ko' | 'en' }
const { language = 'ko' } = Astro.props;
const ko = language === 'ko';
---
<section class="apld-lab" data-apld-lab data-language={language} data-price={APLD_CURRENT_PRICE}>
  <header><p class="kicker">THE ARCHIVE / VALUATION LAB</p><h3>{ko ? 'Applied Digital Corporation Valuation Lab' : 'Applied Digital Corporation Valuation Lab'}</h3><p>{ko ? '계약된 1.41GW가 모든 자본청구권을 거친 뒤 주당 얼마의 가치로 남는지, 가정을 바꿔 보세요.' : 'Change the assumptions behind 1.41GW of contracted capacity and trace what remains for common shareholders after capital claims.'}</p></header>
  <div class="result-grid"><div><span>Bear</span><strong>$0.00</strong></div><div class="primary"><span>Base</span><strong>$5.02</strong></div><div><span>Bull</span><strong>$26.18</strong></div><div><span>{ko ? '현재가' : 'Market price'}</span><strong>${APLD_CURRENT_PRICE}</strong><small>{APLD_PRICE_DATE}</small></div></div>
  <div class="tabs"><button type="button" data-tab="simple" class="active">Simple</button><button type="button" data-tab="advanced">Advanced / Reverse</button></div>
  <div class="layout"><div class="controls"><p class="eyebrow">01 / ASSUMPTIONS</p>
    <label>{ko ? 'NOI 마진' : 'NOI margin'} <output data-value="noi">86%</output><input name="noi" type="range" min="70" max="95" step="1" value="86" /></label>
    <label>{ko ? 'MW당 잔여 CAPEX' : 'Residual CAPEX / MW'} <output data-value="capex">$12M</output><input name="capex" type="range" min="8" max="16" step=".5" value="12" /></label>
    <label>{ko ? '할인율' : 'Discount rate'} <output data-value="discount">8.5%</output><input name="discount" type="range" min="6" max="14" step=".5" value="8.5" /></label>
    <label>{ko ? '재임대 NOI 유지율' : 'Reletting NOI retention'} <output data-value="reletting">85%</output><input name="reletting" type="range" min="40" max="110" step="5" value="85" /></label>
    <label data-advanced hidden>{ko ? '추가 계약 MW' : 'Additional contracted MW'} <output data-value="mw">0 MW</output><input name="mw" type="range" min="0" max="1000" step="25" value="0" /></label>
  </div><div class="bridge"><p class="eyebrow">02 / EQUITY BRIDGE</p><dl><div><dt>{ko ? '계약 임대료' : 'Contracted minimum rent'}</dt><dd>$35.73B</dd></div><div><dt>{ko ? '기본 임대료 (Q1)' : 'Base rent (Q1)'}</dt><dd>$65.8M</dd></div><div><dt>{ko ? 'HPC NOI (Q1)' : 'HPC NOI (Q1)'}</dt><dd>$58.8M</dd></div><div><dt>{ko ? '잔여 건설·자본청구권' : 'Construction and capital claims'}</dt><dd>{ko ? '공시·계약별 재검증 필요' : 'Requires project-level verification'}</dd></div><div class="total"><dt>{ko ? '시나리오 신호' : 'Scenario signal'}</dt><dd data-out="signal">Base assumptions remain below market</dd></div></dl><p>{ko ? '이 Lab은 공개된 계약과 저자 가정을 분리한 민감도 도구입니다. 캠퍼스별 CAPEX와 현금분배가 완전히 공개되지 않아, 슬라이더 결과를 가격목표로 읽어서는 안 됩니다.' : 'This Lab separates disclosed contracts from author assumptions. Because project CAPEX and cash distributions are not fully public, slider output is a sensitivity signal—not a price target.'}</p></div></div>
  <section class="reverse"><p class="eyebrow">03 / REVERSE VALUATION</p><h4>{ko ? '현재가를 설명하려면 무엇이 더 필요한가?' : 'What else must be true to support the market price?'}</h4><p data-out="reverse">The provisional Base case implies meaningful additional project NAV, lower capital cost, or lower residual CAPEX.</p></section>
  <p class="note">{ko ? `출처: Applied Digital FY2027 Q1 10-Q·실적자료. 기본 임대료 ${apldReported.baseRent}M, 구축서비스 ${apldReported.tenantBuildServices}M는 의도적으로 분리했다. 교육용 리서치 도구이며 투자 권유가 아니다.` : `Sources: Applied Digital FY2027 Q1 10-Q and earnings materials. Base rent (${apldReported.baseRent}M) and tenant build services (${apldReported.tenantBuildServices}M) are deliberately separated. Educational research tool, not investment advice.`}</p>
</section>
<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-apld-lab]').forEach((root) => {
    let advanced = false; const get = (name: string) => root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>(`[name="${name}"]`)!;
    const out = (name: string) => root.querySelector<HTMLOutputElement>(`[data-value="${name}"]`)!;
    const write = (name: string, text: string) => { const node = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>(`[data-out="${name}"]`); if (node) node.textContent = text; };
    const render = () => { const noi=Number(get('noi').value), capex=Number(get('capex').value), discount=Number(get('discount').value), reletting=Number(get('reletting').value), mw=Number(get('mw').value); out('noi').value=`${noi}%`; out('capex').value=`$${capex}M`; out('discount').value=`${discount.toFixed(1)}%`; out('reletting').value=`${reletting}%`; out('mw').value=`${mw.toLocaleString()} MW`; const score=(noi-86)*.5+(12-capex)*1.25+(8.5-discount)*1.5+(reletting-85)*.08+mw*.008; const signal=score>=4?'Assumptions begin to close the market-value gap':score>=0?'Still requires incremental NAV or cheaper capital':'Base economics remain below the market price'; write('signal',signal); write('reverse',`At these inputs, the market still requires ${score>=4?'less':'more'} value from lower CAPEX, lower discount rates, stronger re-letting, or additional positive-NPV MW.`); };
    root.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('input').forEach(i=>i.addEventListener('input',render)); root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-tab]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{advanced=button.dataset.tab==='advanced'; root.querySelectorAll('[data-advanced]').forEach(e=>{(e as HTMLElement).hidden=!advanced}); root.querySelectorAll('[data-tab]').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',(b as HTMLElement).dataset.tab===button.dataset.tab)); render();})); render();
  });
</script>
<style>
  .apld-lab{margin:2.5rem 0;padding:clamp(.85rem,3vw,1.4rem);border:1px solid var(--border);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--surface) 88%,#2b5876 12%);overflow:hidden} header h3{margin:.2rem 0}.kicker,.eyebrow{font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700}.result-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.7rem;margin:1rem 0}.result-grid>div,.reverse{min-width:0;padding:1rem;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border)}.result-grid span,.result-grid small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.75rem}.result-grid strong{display:block;font-size:clamp(1.05rem,4vw,1.3rem);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.primary{border-color:#34799f!important}.tabs{display:flex;gap:.5rem;margin:1rem 0}.tabs button{padding:.45rem .7rem}.tabs .active{background:#34799f;color:white}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:1rem}.controls,.bridge{min-width:0;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--border)}label{display:block;margin:.9rem 0;font-size:.86rem}output{float:right;font-weight:700}input{display:block;width:100%;margin-top:.5rem}dl div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:.8rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:.55rem 0}dt,dd{margin:0}.bridge dd{max-width:58%;text-align:right;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.total{font-weight:700}.bridge p,.note{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted)}.reverse{margin-top:1rem}.note{margin-bottom:0}@media(max-width:640px){.result-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.45rem}.result-grid>div{padding:.75rem}.tabs button{flex:1}.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.7rem}.controls,.bridge{padding:.85rem}.bridge dd{max-width:62%;font-size:.78rem}.reverse{padding:.85rem}.apld-lab h3{font-size:1.15rem}}
</style>
